  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civic Participation - Civic Education and Democratic Culture</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Participa&#xe7;&#xe3;o C&#xed;vica - Educa&#xe7;&#xe3;o C&#xed;vica e Cultura Democr&#xe1;tica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civic Participation - Strengthen a political and civic culture which is supportive of democratic institutions and processes; active citizen participation; civic virtues, such as tolerance and gender equality; and other civic skills, attitudes, and behaviors. This includes, but is not limited to, informal civic education initiatives as well as the expansion of civic education in formal education systems. Includes community-based civic actions.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Participa&#xe7;&#xe3;o C&#xed;vica - Fortalecer uma cultura pol&#xed;tica e c&#xed;vica que apoie as institui&#xe7;&#xf5;es e processos democr&#xe1;ticos; participa&#xe7;&#xe3;o ativa dos cidad&#xe3;os; virtudes c&#xed;vicas, como a toler&#xe2;ncia e a igualdade de g&#xe9;nero; e outras habilidades, atitudes e comportamentos c&#xed;vicos. Isto inclui, mas n&#xe3;o est&#xe1; limitado a, iniciativas informais de educa&#xe7;&#xe3;o c&#xed;vica, bem como a expans&#xe3;o da educa&#xe7;&#xe3;o c&#xed;vica nos sistemas de ensino formal. Inclui a&#xe7;&#xf5;es c&#xed;vicas comunit&#xe1;rias.</narrative>
  </description>
